---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — STM Balance"
  description="Privacy Policy of STM Balance and Platforma SAS."
  language="en"
  pagePath="privacy"
  includeApplicationSchema={false}
>
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-container">
      <p class="section-label">STM Balance</p>

      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

      <p>
        Last updated: September 14, 2026
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2>1. Data Controller</h2>

        <p>
          STM Balance is a product developed by Platforma SAS,
          a company incorporated in Uruguay.
        </p>

        <p>
          Platforma SAS is responsible for the processing of personal data
          that may eventually be collected through the STM Balance website
          and services associated with the project.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Legal Framework</h2>

        <p>
          Personal data will be processed in accordance with the laws and
          regulations in force in the Oriental Republic of Uruguay, including
          Law No. 18,331 on Personal Data Protection and Habeas Data,
          together with its applicable regulatory and complementary rules.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Data Collected Through This Website</h2>

        <p>
          In its current version, this website is informational and does not
          include registration forms, user accounts, payment systems or
          mechanisms intended to directly request personal data from visitors.
        </p>

        <p>
          The website also currently does not use its own advertising tracking
          tools or analytics services intended to create individual profiles
          of visitors.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Future Features and Services</h2>

        <p>
          STM Balance is under development. In the future, features may be
          introduced that require the processing of personal data, for example
          services related to user accounts, STM cards, trip history,
          mobility, support, communications or integrations with third parties.
        </p>

        <p>
          Before carrying out additional processing of personal data, this
          Privacy Policy will be updated where appropriate, and users will be
          provided with the relevant information regarding the purposes and
          applicable conditions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Purposes of Processing</h2>

        <p>
          When STM Balance collects personal data, such data will be used only
          for specific and legitimate purposes related to the provision,
          improvement, security and development of the services offered.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Disclosure of Data to Third Parties</h2>

        <p>
          Platforma SAS will not sell users' personal data.
        </p>

        <p>
          Data may be disclosed to or processed by third parties only when
          necessary to provide a service, comply with a legal obligation,
          perform an authorized integration or when another legitimate basis
          exists under applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>7. Security</h2>

        <p>
          Platforma SAS will adopt reasonable technical and organizational
          measures designed to protect personal data against loss, alteration,
          unauthorized access, disclosure or improper processing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>8. Data Subject Rights</h2>

        <p>
          Individuals whose personal data is processed may exercise the rights
          recognized by Uruguayan law, including, where applicable, the rights
          of access, rectification, updating, inclusion, deletion and objection
          in relation to their personal data.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>9. Cookies</h2>

        <p>
          In its current version, the STM Balance website does not use
          first-party cookies intended for user tracking, personalized
          advertising or profiling.
        </p>

        <p>
          If technologies requiring cookies or similar mechanisms are
          introduced in the future, this policy will be updated as appropriate.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>10. Third-Party Services and Links</h2>

        <p>
          The website may in the future include links to or integrations with
          third-party platforms and services. Such third parties may apply
          their own privacy policies and terms, over which Platforma SAS has
          no control.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>11. Changes to This Policy</h2>

        <p>
          Platforma SAS may update this Privacy Policy to reflect changes to
          STM Balance, new features, legal requirements or changes in personal
          data processing practices.
        </p>

        <p>
          The current version will be available on this page and will indicate
          the date of its latest update.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>12. Contact</h2>

        <p>
          Questions related to privacy and personal data protection may be
          addressed to Platforma SAS through the official STM Balance contact
          channels.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
